            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The availability of a wide spectrum of analgesics (both opioid and nonopioid) to control pain, and the science evolving around their use, increases the potential for well-controlled pain. Nurses must learn this science in order to better serve their patients.</AbstractText>
